  "heading_2": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "jcr:title": "Nanosecond Accuracy, MEMS Reliability, Network-Wide Timing Confidence",
   "type": "h3",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
  }
 },
 "/content/copia-teste/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/sitime/sitime-network-synchronizers/jcr:content/root/container/text_2_wrap": {
  "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
  "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
  "cq:styleIds": [
   "1717498053499"
  ],
  "text_2": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "text": "<p>As next-gen networks demand tighter timing across distributed architectures, the TimeSync™ Platform from SiTime delivers industry-leading precision and robustness for IEEE 1588 Precision Time Protocol (PTP), Synchronous Ethernet (SyncE), and Global Navigation Satellite System (GNSS) holdover.&nbsp;Unlike traditional quartz-based synchronizers, TimeSync™ integrates MEMS oscillators, DPLLs, and hitless switching logic in a compact, programmable device - resulting in superior resilience, smaller footprint, and longer holdover performance, even in harsh or mobile environments.</p>",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
   "textIsRich": "true"
  }
 },
 "/content/copia-teste/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/sitime/sitime-network-synchronizers/jcr:content/root/container/heading_3_wrap": {
  "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
  "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
  "cq:styleIds": [
   "1717498053499"
  ],
  "heading_3": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "jcr:title": "Key Capabilities",
   "type": "h3",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
  }
 },
 "/content/copia-teste/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/sitime/sitime-network-synchronizers/jcr:content/root/container/text_3_wrap": {
  "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
  "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
  "cq:styleIds": [
   "1717498053499"
  ],
  "text_3": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "text": "<ul>\n<li><b>Integrated DPLL + MEMS Oscillator:&nbsp;</b>Combines digital phase-locked loop with rugged MEMS timing for sub-microsecond alignment under variable network conditions</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Hitless Reference Switching:&nbsp;</b>Maintains continuous, undisturbed operation during timing source transitions or failures</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Precision Holdover:&nbsp;</b>Maintains network sync with nanosecond-level accuracy even during GNSS loss, ideal for edge and indoor deployments</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Multi-Protocol Support:&nbsp;</b>Supports full Synchronous Ethernet and IEEE 1588 PTP timing stacks for a variety of telecom and datacom standards</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Compact Footprint:&nbsp;</b>Designed for space-constrained systems including small cells, fronthaul gateways, microwave backhaul, and C-RAN infrastructure</li>\n</ul>",
   "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
   "textIsRich": "true"
  }
 },
